  sentences:
    nameNPC: Ta
    Lines:
    - "Gi\u1EEFa s\xF4ng, m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc thuy\u1EC1n l\u1EDBn nh\u1EA5t, bu\u1ED3m
      \u0111en, m\xE1i che l\u1EE5a xanh. Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m \u0111\u1EE9ng gi\u1EEFa
      boong t\xE0u, tay ch\u1ED1ng ki\u1EBFm, m\u1EAFt nh\xECn v\u1EC1 b\u1EDD nam."
    - "\xD4ng kho\u1EA3ng ngo\xE0i 50 tu\u1ED5i, r\xE2u t\xF3c b\u1EA1c ph\u01A1,
      nh\u01B0ng d\xE1ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi v\u1EABn v\u1EA1m v\u1EE1. Khu\xF4n m\u1EB7t
      th\xE2m tr\u1EA7m, c\xF3 v\u1EBB ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EEBng tr\u1EA3i qua v\xF4
      s\u1ED1 chi\u1EBFn tr\u1EADn."
